# Go
/backend/nook
/backend/nook-*
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# Uploaded page cover images (internal/assets, NOOK_UPLOADS_DIR) --
# real user-uploaded files, not repo content.
/backend/uploads/

# Frontend
/frontend/node_modules/
/frontend/dist/

# Embedded frontend build (internal/webui) -- `make embed`/`make build`
# copies frontend/dist/ here for go:embed to pick up. index.html stays
# tracked as a placeholder ("frontend not built yet") so a fresh clone
# can `go build` before ever running the frontend build; real builds
# overwrite it, which is expected -- see backend/internal/webui/webui.go.
/backend/internal/webui/dist/*
!/backend/internal/webui/dist/index.html

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
*.swp
.codegraph/
